Package: vabaxos-reminders
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, sound-theme-freedesktop, pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils
Description: Reminders and alarms said aloud
 Write what and when as you would say it, in Italian or English ("alle 15
 chiama Marco", "tra 10 minuti scola la pasta", "domani alle 7 sveglia",
 "ogni giorno alle 8 medicine"). At the right time the screen reader says
 it and a notification stays on screen; an alarm rings for a minute, until
 it is stopped.
